{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17215020.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17215020","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17215020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1721502001:0":{"text":"ヘンドリック卿、君が無事に戻って来て安心したよ。","source_cn":"亨德里克卿，你的归来总算是让我安心了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2435134F6D83ED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1721502002:1":{"text":"ご心配いただき、ありがとうございます、殿下。","source_cn":"承蒙挂念，殿下","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x220827255394A4A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721502003:1":{"text":"よかった……お父様は無事みたいね。殿下と古聖堂の件について話しているのかしら？","source_cn":"太好了……父亲看起来并没有受伤。不过，他在和王子殿下聊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34B508621529FB2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721502004:1":{"text":"……少し二人の話を聞いてみましょう。","source_cn":"……趁此机会，听听看吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E9A23B3A4A37A5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奥利安":{"text":"エイドリアン","source":"奥利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亨德里克":{"text":"ヘンドリック","source":"亨德里克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17215040.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17215040","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17215040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1721504001:1":{"text":"ヘンドリック卿、古聖堂で一体何が起きたんだ？","source_cn":"亨德里克卿，圣古堂里到底发生了什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3211C2B7D9E71E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721504002:1":{"text":"ヘンドリックは古聖堂で起きたことを、エイドリアンに包み隠さず報告した。","source_cn":"亨德里克将他在圣古堂中经历的一切，一五一十地向奥利安王...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C946729F6E9C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721504003:1":{"text":"アレイン女史の失踪を調査している最中、何らかの力で古聖堂の内部へ強制的に転送されたのです。","source_cn":"殿下，属下在调查阿莱茵女士失踪案时，被某种力量强行传送...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x899EF278ABCEF5BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721504004:2":{"text":"そこで、魔法で動く鎧や魔物の襲撃を受けました――あれは事故ではなく、あらかじめ仕組まれていたものだと思われます。","source_cn":"在那里，属下遭遇了被魔法驱动的活动盔甲和魔物的袭击——...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CA626D38E3E4AA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721504005:1":{"text":"動く鎧？古聖堂に魔物……？ヘンドリック卿、つまり君は、今回の件は人の手による襲撃だと言いたいんだな？","source_cn":"活动盔甲？圣古堂里的魔物？亨德里克卿，你是想说这是一场...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA05E3E60AF9AE9F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721504006:1":{"text":"はい。さらに不可解なのは、カリバーンがひとりでに台座から浮かび上がり、魔物を退けたことです。そのような前例は聞いたことがありません。この件には、まだ何か裏があるはずです。","source_cn":"正是。更令人生疑的是，随后石中剑竟自行出鞘“驱逐”了魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC223AFE7E53D73F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721504007:1":{"text":"ただ……その直後、再び強制的に送り返されてしまい、それ以上の手がかりは得られておりません。","source_cn":"只是……这件事情发生后属下就再次被强行传送了回来，所以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC1A6F2F2F9516B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721504008:1":{"text":"なるほど……","source_cn":"我明白了，亨德里克卿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BCBAEE84426CC50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721504009:1":{"text":"古聖堂が消えた時、その場にいたのは姫様と宮廷魔術師のカスティー殿だけです。あのお二人なら、より詳しい事情をご存じかもしれません。","source_cn":"不过，圣古堂消失时，公主殿下和魔法师科丝蒂是唯二在场的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF97494188750CDB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721504010:1":{"text":"だがペギーは……彼女も宮廷魔術師も、まだ戻ってきていない。","source_cn":"但佩吉她……和宫廷魔法师仍未归来。她们很可能还被困在那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AA5426522EBCA05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721504011:1":{"text":"二人はまだ消えた古聖堂の中にいるのかもしれない……","source_cn":"我认为，她们应该还被困在那个消失的圣古堂中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC490110E16FC137","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721504012:2":{"text":"殿下、これは偶然ではありません！敵の手口も狙いも不明ですが、王室の安全はすでに脅かされています。どうかご用心ください。","source_cn":"殿下，这绝非偶然！对方手段隐秘、目标不明，已威胁到王室...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D0EEA8496BD0386","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721504013:1":{"text":"もちろんだ。だが、今回の件でサバンナでは噂が後を絶たず、人々は不安を募らせている……","source_cn":"我自然不会放松警惕。但眼下赛凡纳流言四起、人心惶惶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD85E89CA88A8EDE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721504014:1":{"text":"私は王太子としての責務を全うしなければならない。今日の上層街での公務には、予定どおり私自身が出席するよ。","source_cn":"我必须履行王储的职责，今日原定的上城区公务，我仍需亲自出席。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F6C870CA36FB6D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721504015:1":{"text":"ですが、今最優先すべきは殿下の安全です。敵の正体も分からない今、危険を冒すべきではないと思います。","source_cn":"殿下，您的安全才是第一要务。幕后黑手的手段太过隐秘，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE94C0ACFB523DD28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1721504016:1":{"text":"分かっている。けれど、それが私の責務なんだ。","source_cn":"这是我的责任，亨德里克卿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x509F82E9C9D0D10D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1721504017:2":{"text":"……でしたら、護衛として私も同行させてください。","source_cn":"……既然如此，请允许属下全程随行护卫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC8E4500C5A0DB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1721504018:1":{"text":"分かった。よろしく頼むよ、ヘンドリック卿。","source_cn":"好吧。那就劳烦你了，亨德里克卿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x733262766B0556CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1721504019:0":{"text":"グウィネス、なぜここに！","source_cn":"格温妮丝，你怎么在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DF2234E36E8E4C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奥利安":{"text":"エイドリアン","source":"奥利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"ナレーション","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亨德里克":{"text":"ヘンドリック","source":"亨德里克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17215060.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17215060","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17215060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721506001:1":{"text":"……エイドリアン様、指揮官。","source_cn":"……司令，殿下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC15AFA8BBEB06CD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721506002:1":{"text":"グウィネス隊長、なぜここにいるのか説明してもらおうか！","source_cn":"格温妮丝队长！解释你的行为！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3213358F94848CC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721506003:1":{"text":"無断で持ち場を離れたうえ、殿下への軍事報告まで盗み聞きしていたのか？","source_cn":"未经许可擅离职守，还躲在暗处窃听王储的高级军事汇报？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B5BADB3EB32BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721506004:2":{"text":"申し訳ありません、指揮官！指揮官が王宮に戻られたと聞き、いても立ってもいられず……すべて私の落ち度です！","source_cn":"万分抱歉，司令！属下听闻王宫内有您出现的消息，一时情急...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3091A9B8D765DDEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721506005:1":{"text":"そのくらいにしてやれ、ヘンドリック卿。ここは軍営じゃないんだ。","source_cn":"好了，亨德里克卿，不必如此苛责。这里可不是军营。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE420A61FE47BB6C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721506006:1":{"text":"グウィネスは君を心配して取り乱しただけだろう。娘にそこまで厳しく当たることはないじゃないか。","source_cn":"格温妮丝也是因为担心你的安危才会乱了方寸，别对自己的女...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06B48FCC492E54DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721506007:1":{"text":"殿下のご寛容に感謝いたします。ですが、軍規は軍規です。グウィネス隊長、駐屯地へ戻って待機せよ！このようなことは二度と繰り返すな！","source_cn":"殿下宽容，但军纪不可废。格温妮丝队长，准备返回守备军驻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40195C5018134D97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721506008:1":{"text":"……承知いたしました、指揮官。","source_cn":"……是，司令。属下遵命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x972DED43E809FAF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721506009:1":{"text":"お恥ずかしいところをお見せして、申し訳ありません、殿下。さあ、公務へ参りましょう。","source_cn":"让殿下见笑了，别耽误了您的行程，我们现在出发吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE53579F2F8A103AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721506010:1":{"text":"ああ、行こう。","source_cn":"走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90D5CC2650CAC0B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721506011:1":{"text":"エイドリアンとヘンドリックは侍衛たちを従えて足早に立ち去り、その足音もやがて通路の奥へと消えていった。","source_cn":"奥利安与亨德里克在侍卫的簇拥下快步离开，脚步声逐渐消失...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC33BFE9D9F5258A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721506012:1":{"text":"彼らが完全に遠ざかったと確信するまで、グウィネスはずっと直立不動の姿勢を崩さなかった。","source_cn":"格温妮丝一直维持着立正的姿势，直到确信他们已经走远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x614363E47C7FA63D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1721506013:1":{"text":"……今、駐屯地に戻っても時間を無駄にするだけだわ。この件が魔法による陰謀だとしたら――","source_cn":"……现在返回驻地只是在浪费时间。既然此事有可能是关乎于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18994C4C51145CBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1721506014:1":{"text":"宮廷魔法院に何か手がかりがないか、見に行ってみましょう。","source_cn":"不如趁机去一躺魔法事务司，或许那会有什么线索。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D3AD015658F370F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1721506015:1":{"text":"あそこはカスティーさんの職場でもあるし。彼女がこの件に関わっているとは限らないけど、行ってみる価値はあるはず。","source_cn":"那里也是科丝蒂的办公处，虽然她不一定与此事相关，但去确...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BD58050C8DD1DED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docum