tory_id":"17215090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721509001:1":{"text":"すみません、守備軍のグウィネスです。","source_cn":"抱歉打扰了，我是守备军的格温妮丝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF97EB04349E7851B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721509002:1":{"text":"わっ、びっくりした……グウィネス隊長でしたか。突然どうされたんです？","source_cn":"啊！吓到了我……原来是守备军的格温妮丝队长啊。你怎么来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC67230C911F8779B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721509003:1":{"text":"ペギー様の失踪の件で来ました。同行されている宮廷魔術師の<style=\"highlight\">カスティー</style>さんについて確認したいことがありまして。","source_cn":"我是为了佩吉公主失踪一案来的。我需要核实关于随行法师—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA66B2AA5FDE8BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721509004:1":{"text":"あなたは彼女の同僚ですよね。よければ、彼女が普段どんな人なのか教えてもらえますか？","source_cn":"阁下是她的同僚，平时觉得她是个什么样的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x129BE438251F19FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721509005:1":{"text":"カスティーはいい後輩ですよ！無口で、いつも本を読んでいますけど、僕が作った書類の校正に付き合ってくれるのは、彼女だけなんです。","source_cn":"科丝蒂啊？她可是个大好人！虽然话不多，总是埋头看书，但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7B3FF3F25ABC40F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docume